Description: opencltools provides runtime OpenCL support for R: probe hardware
    and drivers, load and concatenate kernel sources, and manage
    dependency-annotated .cl libraries—so packages like nmathopencl (and other
    ported libraries) can offer GPU acceleration without each reimplementing
    the same plumbing.
